# Example10 typically runs in local/degraded mode on a fresh setup.
# Set EXAMPLE10_USE_MCP_LIVE=1 to explicitly enable live MCP mode.
# Compatible EXAMPLE10_MCP_* settings, TAVILY_API_KEY, and FRED_API_KEY may also let live mode be inferred automatically.
# Set EXAMPLE10_USE_MCP_LIVE=0 to force local/degraded mode.
